      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Invasive catheterization can lead to mechanically induced spasm of coronary arteries. In this case report, CT angiography allowed us to unmask catheter-induced coronary spasm as the underlying reason for isolated left main coronary artery stenosis seen in invasive angiography."},
